Hey guys!
We are almost ready to release our first update. It's based on all the feedback collected in these first weeks after release.
This update will contain:

. Key binding and controller support;
. Increased speed and agility for the player's robot;
. Improved camera post-effects, optimized and full-featured;
. HUD scale settings, for higher DPI screens adjustments;
. More descriptive and detailed tutorial hints;
. Balanced drops (more credits, ammo and fuel);
. Improved enemy AI and difficulty levels;
. Several bugs and warnings fixed;
. Compiler version updated.

The new map is being designed and should be ready by mid-end of this month, together with some more features.

We are also progressing on the multiplayer co-op feature, planned to be working in the next couple of months!
